<h2></h2>
<h2>Overview/Goal</h2>
<p>My goal was to create a level iteratively for a third person shooter. I planned my level in Adobe Illustrator starting with a node based diagram, then using a Melan diagram to ensure players decisions got them to different places in the map. I then used this to whitebox the level in Unreal, also utilising feedback from group playtests to improve on previous designs.</p>
